<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea may file WTO chip complaint against US.</title>
<headline>S.Korea may file WTO chip complaint against US.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's trade ministry on Friday said it would file a petition against the U.S. with the World Trade Organisation (WTO) for unfair anti-dumping measures against semi-conductors, newspaper reports said.</p>
<p>According to the reports, the ministry decided to file the complaint as the U.S. continued to levy anti-dumping duty on South Korean chips even though earlier dumping charges were not upheld, the papers said.</p>
<p>Ministry officials were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5648</p>
</text>
